---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Data Processing Agreement - CloudDroid" description="CloudDroid Data Processing Agreement for enterprise customers.">
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Data Processing Agreement</h1>
      <p class="text-slate text-lg">Data processing terms for CloudDroid customers.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">Effective date: 23 August 2026. Last updated: 23 August 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">1. Parties</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">This Data Processing Agreement ("DPA") forms part of the Terms of Service between the customer ("Controller") and <strong>RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.</strong>, IČO 23389702, Soukenická 877/9, Ostrava, 702 00, Czech Republic ("Processor").</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">2. Scope of Processing</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Processor processes personal data on behalf of Controller solely to provide the CloudDroid service, including hosting Android workspaces, storing account data, and generating operational logs.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">3. Data Categories</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
          <li>Account credentials and authentication data</li>
          <li>Usage metadata and instance metrics</li>
          <li>Audit logs and security events</li>
          <li>Payment metadata processed by Dodo Payments and Mollie</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">4. Security Measures</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Processor implements technical and organizational measures including TLS 1.3 encryption in transit, access controls, audit logging, rate limiting, and regular dependency review.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">5. Subprocessors</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Processor uses the following subprocessors:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Dodo Payments</strong> — payment processing</li>
          <li><strong>Mollie</strong> — payment processing</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — font delivery</li>
          <li><strong>Cloud Infrastructure Provider</strong> — infrastructure and database storage</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">6. Data Subject Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Processor assists Controller in responding to data subject requests including access, rectification, erasure, and portability. Requests should be submitted to support@clouddroid.eu.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">Personal data is retained for the duration of the subscription and as required by law. Upon account deletion, personal data is removed within 30 days unless retention is required for legal or fraud-prevention purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-slate">For DPA-related questions, contact <a href="mailto:support@clouddroid.eu" class="text-navy underline">support@clouddroid.eu</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
